cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ResearchDataHub in research, please cite it as below."
title: ResearchDataHub
abstract: >-
  Multi-source research data acquisition and synchronization framework for climate
  and Earth science: source discovery (Copernicus CDS, NSF NCAR GDEX/RDA), transfer
  scheduling with resumable downloads and bounded concurrency, SQLite-backed task
  manifest with lease/heartbeat recovery, layered integrity verification, atomic
  staging-to-raw publication, and auditable delivery manifests.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Neiyako/ResearchDataHub
url: https://github.com/Neiyako/ResearchDataHub
keywords:
  - climate data
  - earth science
  - data acquisition
  - ERA5
  - reproducibility
  - data integrity
authors:
